Never pickup all food, don't pick up corpses, except lichen corpses? 
Just
leave % out of pickup_types and add

autopickup_exception="<*lichen*corpse*"

Or did you mean, pickup all food, don't pickup corpses, but do pickup
lichen corpses?  In that case, I don't believe so.  You can have the
first two, but the never pickup corpses ">*corpse*" will override
always pickup lichen corpses "<*lichen*corpse*".

I prefer to use the following:

"<*tripe*"
">*ration*"
">*lichen*corpse*"
">*newt*corpse*"

with % left out of my pickup_types.  This way, I get newt and lichen
corpses, all food rations, c-rations, and k-rations, but not tripe
rations.

